{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/sendian-arada-properties-tilal","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":224,"crm_id":"354","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Sendian","slug":"sendian-arada-properties-tilal","display_address":"Tilal","building_type":["townhouse","villa"],"completion_year":"2023","developer":"Arada Properties","price":2000000,"display_price":"2M","lattitude":25.2584596,"longitude":55.5897407,"min_bedrooms":2,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Sendian is the first residential community in Masaar, a new development by Arada Developer and offers a mix of townhouses and villas in Sharjah. Here, you can choose from<strong> 2, 3 &amp; 4 bedroom townhouses as 4 and 5 Bedroom Park villas, as 4 bedroom semi-detached villas</strong> that are designed to let you and your family thrive and live in the midst of absolute comfort.</p><p>The nature-inspired homes are surrounded by an abundance of green spaces. Each of the units offers direct access to a park. Moreover, the serene setting is perfect for you to relax and unwind. Made available with an attractive payment plan, the family-oriented units come equipped with smart home features as standard. These units situated right in the heart of this gated residential community, the development also features a community centre offering a host of activities. Children, in particular, will have a safe and secured environment, where they will get an opportunity to explore the world and have a great time.</p><p>The homes come in a warm-toned or cool-toned colour scheme. When it comes to the interiors and the overall layout, the design and use of contemporary elements present a whole new dimension of living.</p><p>For a project of this size and scale, it does meet the highest possible construction standards and promotes the virtue of smart and sustainable living.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/bElZ8yDrwgfqwzGC17ogqlucd5LptBYpBQUZtSky.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/31/bElZ8yDrwgfqwzGC17ogqlucd5LptBYpBQUZtSky.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/Zsc8a8Ed1IsNPlWB4U7Myz8UyCjtF1TsXWO0DloG.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/31/Zsc8a8Ed1IsNPlWB4U7Myz8UyCjtF1TsXWO0DloG.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/75cTi3XXirvjDO4rzgz9SDWoA9BtBeohzA76d8US.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/31/75cTi3XXirvjDO4rzgz9SDWoA9BtBeohzA76d8US.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/XJCVNyAcu2PYpnQxhya3nC8QM5XGKOssaAnMSX7X.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/31/XJCVNyAcu2PYpnQxhya3nC8QM5XGKOssaAnMSX7X.png","__ggfxIndex":3},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/Yjn2h3krtZsJAtchbB6aVpSqQPIKvDSDO1XL5RHM.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/31/Yjn2h3krtZsJAtchbB6aVpSqQPIKvDSDO1XL5RHM.png","__ggfxIndex":4},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/3TasQS6KfClAtQQ3zYJROAgX2I1ia2bH6G64Fyaf.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/31/3TasQS6KfClAtQQ3zYJROAgX2I1ia2bH6G64Fyaf.png","__ggfxIndex":5},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/354/images/2024/07/31/V6vqUviDKWZkguXdoqcSQapeUml6e1OalLKE8FJX.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/07/31/V6vqUviDKWZkguXdoqcSQapeUml6e1OalLKE8FJX.png","__ggfxIndex":6}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":3086,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2023/07/21